## Why This Is Asked

Tests understanding of memory ordering, atomicity, and visibility when sharing memory across threads without OS-provided synchronization.

## Key Concepts

- Atomicity of multi-byte writes
- Memory ordering (memory_order_seq_cst, acquire/release)
- Visibility across cores
- Practical synchronization primitives (mutex, atomic ops)

